//steamcommunity.com/id/SirAntonius/", "num_games_owned": 465, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 1028, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 902, "last_played": 1492814030, "avatar": "ab1a827e2157192266669d17b1f4eaf112d52b09"}, "language": "english", "review": "Levels are boring and uninspired. Rehashing the same grey/brown levels (kinda)  Mission menu (star system screen) is a disaster.  Cannot join friends directly and thats with an 100mbit down and 100mbit up connection. Frequent lag for no reason at all. \n\nBut even with that, i kinda had fun playing it. But only with some friends that know where to find the right menu options and things like that. For someone who boots up the game and is a total newcomer it's a disaster to get playing.\n\nGrafics wise the game has for me the real meh/blegh factor. Because the only colours that are used are grey and brown.\nLevel design is sometimes just straight out weird and the minimap.... Oh god that ***** minimap, witch is no help to you at all.", "timestamp_created": 1401560010, "timestamp_updated": 1401560010, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}